# Components

Each folder here is one component (flocms-frontend): its class, its template
and, when it needs them, its CSS and JavaScript.

    components/pricing/
        Pricing.php      the class (namespace App\Components): name, props, data
        pricing.html     the template
        pricing.css      optional: linked only on pages that use it
        pricing.js       optional: the same

Create one with `php flo site:component Pricing --css --js`.

A folder with the name of one of the package's components replaces its files:
`components/hero/hero.html` alone changes the hero's markup and keeps its
props; `components/hero/hero.css` alone restyles it.

List them all with `php flo site:components`.
